  "category": "ComfyUI / partner/video/Kling",
  "description": "KlingLipSyncTextToVideoNode — Kling Lip Sync Text to Video Node. Syncs mouth movements in a video file to a text prompt. The video file should not be larger than 100MB, should have height/width between 720px and 1920px, and should be between 2s and 10s in length.",
